blogpage["jsonld"] is blog_jsonld
push blogpage to pages

note ---- machine files ----
read file "site/content/llms.body.txt" giving llms_text
site["llms_body"] is llms_text
site["pages"] is pages

note ---- build ----
written is sitegen_build with site
show ("site built: " + (text of (length of written)) + " files into " + base)
